<title>CROATIA: Croatian govt drafts 1997 budget proposal - agency.</title>
<headline>Croatian govt drafts 1997 budget proposal - agency.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Croatian government has drafted a 1997 budget proposal, state news agency Hina reported on Thursday, without giving the total figure.</p>
<p>It said that projected budget revenues would rise by 5.05 percent, but expenditures were planned to be some 2.8 billion kuna higher.</p>
<p>This year's budget totalled 35.6 billion kuna with the deficit of some two percent covered by government borrowing.</p>
<p>-- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
